 137:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/timers.c **** /* The list in which active timers are stored.  Timers are referenced in expire
 138:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/timers.c ****  * time order, with the nearest expiry time at the front of the list.  Only the
 139:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/timers.c ****  * timer service task is allowed to access these lists.
 140:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/timers.c ****  * xActiveTimerList1 and xActiveTimerList2 could be at function scope but that
 141:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/timers.c ****  * breaks some kernel aware debuggers, and debuggers that reply on removing the
 142:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/timers.c ****  * static qualifier. */
